# Unpacked design source. theevent-v1.0.0.zip is the tracked source of truth and
# is what INVENTORY.md cites, so the extracted copy is working material only and
# is reproducible with `unzip theevent-v1.0.0.zip -d design-source`. The
# extraction is not deleted, just not committed twice.
/design-source/

